# Quantumult X - iCloud Private Relay connectivity
# Source: https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
# Import as FILTER resource. Enable policy override and select your proxy.
# Built-in direct is a fallback. Regional eligibility is not changed.
# UDP 443 for mask; TCP 443 for mask-h2 and mask-api. No MITM required.
host, mask.icloud.com, direct
host, mask-h2.icloud.com, direct
host, mask-api.icloud.com, direct
